      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Data",
      "items": [
        "Convex anonymous LOCAL deployment on 127.0.0.1:3210",
        "No account, no auth — data stays on the machine and is still fully reactive",
        "Dev uses the repo's .convex/; packaged uses the OS app-data directory"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "The calendar schedules itself",
      "items": [
        "convex/lib/scheduler.ts is a PURE engine, 21 unit tests, no UI coupling",
        "Schedule-affecting mutations call runReflow; it rewrites unlocked future blocks only",
        "NOT every mutation on those tables reflows — setMicDevice deliberately skips it, and removeProperty/updateProperty/completeSprint currently do not"
      ]
